<title>BELGIUM: TABLE-Belgium to auction OLOs 14, 26 on July 28.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belgium to auction OLOs 14, 26 on July 28.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said it would auction the following linear government bonds (OLOs) on July 28 -</p>
<p>code 265 OLO 14  7.25 pct, 29 April 2004 (BE0000265711)</p>
<p>code 286 OLO 26  6.25 pct, 28 March 2007 (BE0000286923).</p>
<p>Payment is due on July 31.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
